{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The repeated run exposed a second bookkeeping defect in the same path: unrecoverable jobs call `_finish()` and are incorrectly counted as completed. The existing race sometimes masked this by losing an increment, which is why that assertion also appeared intermittent. I’m separating “job finished” (decrement `pending`) from “job succeeded” (increment `completed`)."}}
